  <item>
    <title>13｜年终总结</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6951eabf14db1df9ef38be55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6951eabf14db1df9ef38be55</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Dec 2025 03:02:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>谢谢大家今年的关注！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 对新来的观众说说客气话和心里话。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> “说话需要练习。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> 本期主题：年终总结。第一题：要不要做年终总结？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> 关于“创作与生活”节目的总结。我们的初衷：陪伴创作者，因为创作是孤独的。再回顾题目“创作”和“生活”的关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 陆冉的个人年度总结。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2886">48:06</a> 大叶的个人年度总结。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3425">57:05</a> 今年喜欢的电影和书籍。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大叶的年度推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>书籍——</span></p><span></span><p><span>《西方现代思想十三讲》，汪民安</span></p><span></span><p><span>《气呼呼的小词典》，老安</span></p><span></span><p><span>《色情》，乔治·巴塔耶</span></p><span></span><p><span>《逃出瓶子的精灵》戈尔·格罗特</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑）——</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Sortilège》Preservation/Gabe 'Nandez</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>陆冉的年度推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>书籍——</span></p><span></span><p><span>《认识我的人慢慢忘了我》，周慧</span></p><span></span><p><span>《捕云记》，多和田叶子</span></p><span></span><p><span>《每一句话都坐着别的眼睛》，赫塔·米勒</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影（年度印象最深）——</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一站再战》，保罗·托马斯·安德森</span></p><span></span><p><span>《无可奈何》，朴赞郁</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目剪辑、制作：大叶</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：大叶《灯草行影影绰绰》，出自专辑《甘泉路》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3688">01:01:28</a> 穿搭：风格鲜明的小土妞与基本酷妹。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvB2zFlV28PwUETrfWUg54ILhmrR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>新年快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
